<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">工资归属</view><view class="title">老板管理</view><view class="hint">选择默认老板，开始工作时会固定到本次记录。</view><view class="card entry row" data-id="" bindtap="choose"><view>未指定老板</view><view class="selected">{{!defaultBossId ? '✓' : ''}}</view></view><view wx:for="{{bosses}}" wx:key="id" class="card entry row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="entry-actions"><text class="edit" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="rename">修改</text><text class="selected">{{defaultBossId === item.id ? '✓' : ''}}</text></view></view><button class="primary add" bindtap="add">添加老板</button></view>
